  "watchdog": "Crest: BAS timeout adjustable 5-120 s in MAIN MENU > SETUP > BAS; BAS-supplied temperatures must be refreshed within it or the boiler reverts to its own sensors. Other commands must be refreshed at least every 4 minutes. Hellcat: timeout fixed at 300 s.",
